At the end of the world (or perhaps it is the center) there is a dark tower. It once was a lighthouse but the light has gone out. See no one has worked there. The guides have all gone.

One day, the light comes back on.

Should the gods return?

a creation myth Pt . 1
once there was a tapastry
in which every thread connected in every way with every other thread
and all these threads were infinite
and all their connections were infinte
and we called its name
Fabric of Reality.
it was a knot of possibility
infinite possibility
and yet no understanding was percieved.

Within the tangle, singularly dense
found itself the weaver
themself woven within.

(To be continued)

Part 2

Every thread
The weaver could control.